Package: xfce4-speech-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: speech-dispatcher, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: iso-codes, linux-tts-ruaccent-installer
Breaks: speech-dispatcher-sherpa-onnx (<< 0.1.0+git20261120033650), speech-dispatcher-sherpa (<< 0.1.0+git20261120033650),
        speech-dispatcher-vosk (<< 0.1.0+git20261120033650), speech-dispatcher-kokoro (<< 0.1.0+git20261120033650),
        speech-dispatcher-silero (<< 0.1.0+git20261120033650), speech-dispatcher-teratts (<< 0.1.0+git20261120033650)
Description: speech settings dialog for Xfce
 Chooses the language, the synthesizer and the voice of speech-dispatcher, the
 text-to-speech service of the desktop, and sets the rate, pitch, volume,
 punctuation and audio output. Has a field to test the voice.
 .
 This build appears in the Xfce settings manager; speech-settings-gtk
 is the same dialog for other desktops.

